        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "response_to_critic": "Applied ValidatorAgent's critical fix: reduced find_spruce_sign facing_tolerance from 60° to 45°. The ValidatorAgent correctly identified that with yaw=0 (facing south) at spawn, the sign at (3,0,2) is at approximately 56° off the player's facing direction. With 60° tolerance this would be borderline satisfied at spawn; with 45° tolerance the player must actively turn ~11° more toward the sign before the milestone triggers. The find_black_bed milestone remains unchanged at 60° tolerance and 8-block max_distance since the bed is 12 blocks from spawn (well outside the 8-block threshold), requiring intentional navigation to the hut.",
  "scene_clarification_request": "None — all spatial coordinates confirmed via sandbox. Sign at (3,0,2) with rotation=0 (text faces south), black bed at (12,0,0)/(13,0,0) inside stone hut with doorway at (10,1,0)/(10,2,0). Scene verified working in multiple sandbox runs."
